## 7. Feature Architecture: eBay Teammate Intelligence Panel

The **Teammate Intelligence Panel** is a contextual copilot embedded within the Assisted Service workspace, activating dynamically.

### Feature 1: The Transaction Lifecycle Reconstructor

* **Problem Solved:** Eradicates the 20-minute "context hunt".
* **Mechanism:** Queries an internal federated GraphQL layer to reconstruct all asynchronous transaction events (bids, payment captures, tracking updates) into a single chronological timeline.

### Feature 2: Graph-Grounded Policy Engine (GraphRAG / Neo4j)

* **Problem Solved:** Prevents LLM hallucinations and reliance on outdated KB articles.
* **Architecture:** Ingests external regulatory schemes and eBay policies into a deterministic Neo4j knowledge graph. The AI extracts discrete entities to form a context state vector:

$$ \text{Context} = { \text{Cat: Luxury}, \text{Value: } $5400, \text{Dispute: Visa 10.4}, \text{Auth: Passed} } $$

The engine then traverses a validated mathematical mapping rather than guessing the next token:

$$ (\text{Visa 10.4 SNAD}) \xrightarrow{\text{Governed By}} (\text{Merchant Evidence Standard}) \xrightarrow{\text{Satisfied By}} (\text{Auth Certificate}) $$

### Feature 3: Backward Verification & Explainability Checklist

* **Problem Solved:** Satisfies EU AI Act Article 14 (Human Oversight).
* **Mechanism:** The AI cannot execute an action without rendering a checklist showing the exact nodes it traversed. Agents must manually validate this list before the "Resolve" button activates.

### Feature 4: Automated Accountability Routing (SLA Engine)

* **Problem Solved:** Protects high-value sellers from automated bans due to missed SLAs.
* **Mechanism:** If a Top-Rated Seller is 24 hours away from an evidence SLA breach, the Copilot automatically compiles an evidence packet and routes an urgent escalation to their named eBay Account Manager to intervene offline.

### Feature 5: Context-Aware SME Routing

* **Problem Solved:** Replaces Slack channel blasts and manual handovers.
* **Mechanism:** Reconstructs the active case into a structured packet and queries Workforce Management APIs to route it to the specific, *online* Risk SME whose skill matrix matches the case profile.

