## 8. Enterprise Feasibility & Transformation Analysis (70/20/10)

```mermaid
pie title The Transformation Balance
    "Technology (GraphQL, GraphRAG)" : 10
    "Process (Decoupling AHT, Routing)" : 20
    "People (Adoption, Trust, Change Mgmt)" : 70

```

* **Technology (10%):** Direct LLM integration into legacy microservices will cause latency. Must use an asynchronous GraphQL caching layer for sub-400ms UI rendering.
* **Process (20%):** If agents are still judged strictly on Average Handle Time (AHT), they will blind-click the AI checklists. AHT must be decoupled from high-stakes cases during rollout.
* **People (70%):** Agents will view AI with skepticism or automation bias. Position the Copilot explicitly as a "shield against donkey work," not a surveillance auditor.

